t a more accurate sense of scale so as  you can see I've created a little bit  more order into the space by creating  some continuous lines with these shelves  and by reinforcing symmetry with the  artwork I'm also trying to make the  space feel a little bit more open by  using low Furniture elements and a  scones around eye level to bring down  the sight line and I've added some tall  artworks and Tall curtains to elongate  the space a little bit I'm also creating  two zones with the shelving and the area  rugs in the next phase I'm going to go  through the process of developing a mood  board and a material palette and at that  point I'm also going to print out the  perspectives from the SketchUp model to  play around with the materials so that I  know exactly what pieces I should buy  before going to the store if you're  interested in this procreate brush pack  I have everything from pens to markers  to brushes as well as to people  Silhouettes I'm going to leave that in  the description if you have any  questions on anything that I went  through today just let me know down in  the comments and if you like this video  please give me a thumbs up and stay  tuned for the rest of the renovation  it's going to be very exciting and I  will see you in the next video  foreign

